<title>HUNGARY: Hungary details Jan-April trade gap figures.</title>
<headline>Hungary details Jan-April trade gap figures.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Ministry of Industry, Trade and Tourism (MIT) published detailed January-April trade balance figures on Friday, following publishing rough figures earlier on Friday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE DEFICIT  (in million dollars)</p>
<p>			Jan-April 97  Jan-March 97   Jan-April 96</p>
<p>    Exports	   5,420.9	 3,819.8	    4,914.7</p>
<p>    Import	    6,327.8	 4,509.5	    5,649.7</p>
<p>    Trade balance    -906.9	  -689.7	     -735.0</p>
<p>NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics, while National Bank of Hungary (NBH) trade figures are calculated from cash flow data.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
